# Valgrind suppressions for the native-checks valgrind job.
#
# agecrypt does not link OpenSSL. These leaks come from the `openssl` R
# package (Suggests, used by test-vectors.R for SHA-256), whose R_init_openssl
# loads an OpenSSL 3 provider that is never unloaded. Scoped to libcrypto
# allocations so a leak in agecrypt's own code still fails the job.
{
   openssl-libcrypto-leak
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite,indirect
   fun:*alloc
   ...
   obj:*/libcrypto.so*
}
